  "prompt": "In March 2025, what was each store's average daily net revenue, over the days on which the store sold something? Use the sales table and its order_date column, the UTC day of the order. Count lines with an order_date from 1 March 2025 to 31 March 2025, both days included. A day's revenue is the sum of net_revenue_eur on that day; days with no sales do not count. Return two columns, in this order: store_code and avg_daily_revenue_eur. Return one row for each store that sold something in March 2025. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
